{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09343","headline":"南园陪王卿游瞩 · 韦应物","name":"南园陪王卿游瞩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"形迹虽拘检，世事澹无心。\n郡中多山水，日夕听幽禽。\n几阁文墨暇，园林春景深。\n杂花芳意散，绿池暮色沈。\n君子有高躅，相携在幽寻。\n一酌何爲贵，可以写冲襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09343.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09343","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}